   "key": "func JourneyIntelligenceService.project(shape:elapsed:farthest:)",
   "hash": "f9a970a1311399cf",
   "does": "Projects journey time: returning → total = 2×elapsed-at-farthest, remaining = max(0,total−elapsed) (nil,nil if farthest ≤50 m); outbound → (nil, elapsed) as the turn-around-now return time; other shapes → (nil,nil).",
   "entry": null,
